node_modules/
package-lock.json
out/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Dom's projections -- a paid product, deliberately not built into the board.
# config/sources.json lists only free sources, so the build never reads these;
# they stay in sources/ so you can still import them through the UI on your own
# machine. Keep them out of the repo so publishing it does not redistribute them.
sources/*Fantasy-Projections-Yahoo*
sources/*Fantasy-Projections-Fantrax*

# LineupExperts -- likewise not built into the board, kept local for UI import.
sources/LineupExperts*

# The free factual columns extracted from those workbooks -- positions and ages,
# which are Yahoo's and Fantrax's own rulings rather than projection work -- ARE
# tracked on purpose: the board needs them and the build works without the
# workbooks present. See make_reference.py.
